cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the object-aware paper and the 2DGS work listed in the README."
title: "Object-Aware Loss for Mask-Guided Mesh Reconstruction Based on 2D Gaussian Splatting"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Woo"
    given-names: "Sunghyun"
# Remaining manuscript authors must be added after verification.
repository-code: "https://github.com/WooSungHyun03/FocusGS"
abstract: >-
  Research code for mask-guided object-aware mesh reconstruction based on 2D
  Gaussian Splatting, including alpha polarization, per-Gaussian ObjectMark
  estimation, ObjectMark polarization, pruning, and inherited 2DGS meshing.
